  "publisher": "CQL on Databricks examples",
  "description": "Adults seen during the flu season who received an influenza vaccine during that season. An example measure, written for this repository; not a published measure.",
  "rationale": "A yearly influenza vaccine reduces flu illness, hospital stays and deaths.",
  "guidance": "For a calendar-year measurement period the flu season runs from August 1 of the year before to March 31 of the period's year. A vaccine recorded as not done because the patient objected, or for a medical reason, is a denominator exception. Patients in hospice care are excluded.",
